  "releaseNotes": "'## [10.4.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.3.5...v10.4.0) (2026-04-28)\n\n### Features\n\n* **operator:** add ReconcileStrategy (ByGeneration / ByResourceVersion) ([#1088](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1088)) ([efe3ef1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/efe3ef1591250f5caa0b08ee9f5a6bbb9478e07c)), closes [#803](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/803) [#826](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/826)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **core:** update dependency sonaranalyzer.csharp to 10.24.0.138807 ([#1093](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1093)) ([78a41d4](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/78a41d45a581c1ad1b2c3ff50c7e5cf1e89f21fb))\n* **core:** update dependency sonaranalyzer.csharp to 10.25.0.139117 ([#1099](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1099)) ([67f1f7a](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/67f1f7aae325308728cadfad54449cf65736295c))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1092](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1092)) ([e40c381](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/e40c381e4336a713b74b4799af53638aca85e711))\n\n### Documentation\n\n* fix admonition titles in documentation ([#1096](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1096)) ([14c3bfb](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/14c3bfba4256245684addaa8b7f264ad56a7df05))\n'",
